# Proposed lifecycle; complete contract is normative and qualification remains due.
direction: down
classes: {
  start: {style: {fill: "#25364B"; font-color: "#FFFFFF"; bold: true; stroke-width: 3}}
}
Start: "Start here · Fixed one-pass authority proposal\nK281 decisions → k282 repair + whole review before k269" {class: start}
Qualify: "Q earlier required mechanics / controls\nActual native UID / build / channel / decoder on pure inputs\nScratch source / root mapping never samples the target"
Provision: "Explicit one-time initialization\nIssuance profile + current profile / bridge\nLIVE activation still requires k282 repair"
Ready: "Fixed validated unspent.receipt\nHighest revision / correction; no intent"
Export: "P fresh admission / build / UID / channel\nActual fixed authority + reviewed fresh export\nExclusive checked reservation before intent"
Intent: "Lock receipt; recheck identities\nRetain consume.intent, even partial"
Spent: "Exclusive same-directory rename\nunspent.receipt → spent.receipt"
Original: "Synchronized original start header\nAll required acknowledgements first"
Capture: "A first actual source / root outcomes\nDeclared initial / closure only; no calibration\nRetain original bytes, refusals and prefixes"
Derivative: "Offline exact-byte derivative\nIndependent association verification"
Refuse: "Consumed / uncertain: refuse\nCleanup never restores authority"
Limit: "Complete repair + whole review before k269\nRequired Q / P U blocks; A outcomes follow consumption\nPre-intent export loss does not consume authority"
Start -> Qualify: "1 · no operation evidence supplied"
Qualify -> Provision: "1a · qualified separate initializer / validator"
Provision -> Ready: "2 · external validation"
Ready -> Export: "3 · complete prerequisites"
Export -> Intent: "4 · valid export first"
Intent -> Spent: "5 · irreversible transition"
Spent -> Original: "6 · sync and name checks"
Original -> Capture: "7 · only then contact"
Capture -> Derivative: "8 · frozen originals"
Derivative -> Limit: "9 · no new permission"
Intent -> Refuse: "4a · partial / death"
Spent -> Refuse: "5a · rename / sync failure"
Original -> Refuse: "6a · incomplete start"
Capture -> Refuse: "7a · failed / lost original"
Derivative -> Refuse: "8a · failed / lost export"
